<title>PERU: Edelnor Q1 net edges up 3.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Edelnor Q1 net edges up 3.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share - N.A.</p>
<p>Net - 32.19 million soles vs 31.21 million soles</p>
<p>Revs - 10.84 million soles vs 15.32 million soles</p>
<p>NOTES: Edelnor is an electricty distributor controlled by the Distrilima consortium composed of Spain's Endesa and Chilean companies Enersis and Chilectra.</p>
<p>((-- Andrew Cawthorne, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
